Package: pinteresturl
Type: Package
Title: Parse and Normalize Pinterest URLs
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("SavePinner", "Contributors", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "jiankn@users.noreply.github.com")
Description: Parses, classifies, and normalizes public Pinterest URLs without
    making network requests. Supports Pin, short, profile, board, and Ideas
    URLs across Pinterest country domains while rejecting lookalike hosts,
    credentials, non-HTTPS URLs, encoded paths, and non-standard ports.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://savepinner.com/pinterest-downloader/, https://github.com/jiankn/pinterest-url-normalizer-r
BugReports: https://github.com/jiankn/pinterest-url-normalizer-r/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
